 },
 {
  "work_id": "w_R4HF7D972FS5",
  "campo": "sinopsis.en",
  "valor": "In 1970s Barcelona, Moroccan migrants arrive at train stations. With images of their faces and suitcases, of the marginal neighborhoods where they settle, and audio testimonies, this militant documentary, filmed clandestinely in the final years of the Franco regime, denounces the discrimination and precarity they face.",
